<title>USA: Conseco holders approve share increase. [CORRECTED 22:23 GMT]</title>
<headline>Conseco holders approve share increase. [CORRECTED 22:23 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Wednesday that shareholders at the annual meeting approved an increase in authorized common shares to one billion from 500 million.</p>
<p>The financial services company also said its board approved an unchanged quarterly dividend of $0.03125 a share, payable July 1, record June 20. (Company corrects dividend amount from $0.0325).</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
